cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "AI-Fiscal: AI labor-to-capital shift fiscal microsimulation"
abstract: >
  AI-Fiscal estimates the federal-revenue and distributional consequences
  of an AI-driven shift in factor income shares (labor to capital), built
  on the Budget Lab Tax-Simulator microsimulation. Inputs are calibrated
  against Karger et al. 2026 (NBER w35046) AI-adoption trajectories; the
  pipeline routes the implied capital flow across tax units (Smith-Yagan-
  Zidar pass-through split) and across income types, then runs Tax-
  Simulator to produce per-cell revenue and distributional deltas.
